# IndexerTypeProvider implementations discoverable via ServiceLoader. Each exposes an Indexer class whose
# `public static final String INDEXER_TYPE` names its `indexer.type`. IndexerFactory reads the type name and
# constructs the Indexer, without lucille-core referencing backend classes by name.
#
# These are the in-core indexers that need no search client. The Solr, OpenSearch, and Elasticsearch providers
# live in their own plugin modules (lucille-solr, lucille-opensearch, lucille-elasticsearch) and register
# themselves through their own copies of this service file.
com.kmwllc.lucille.indexer.provider.CSVIndexerProvider
com.kmwllc.lucille.indexer.provider.NopIndexerProvider
